  "adaptations": [
    "Optimizer and A* use CollisionMap interface; numerical objectives unchanged.",
    "GridMap gains explicit origin+endpoint update API. Fixed whole window inflation rebuild avoids stale local halo.",
    "GridMap ray traversal tags widened to int to prevent repeated-frame char overflow; index inflation bounds checked per axis.",
    "The EGO sensor-origin cell is explicitly observed free if previously unobserved; existing occupied cells are not cleared.",
    "A* edges are sampled at half voxel spacing to reject corner cutting; both backends use one extra guidance voxel.",
    "ROG core is taken from SUPER pinned commit; ROS callbacks disabled. Adapter replaces sphere kernel with common cube before init.",
    "No follower, target estimator, visibility objective, or swarm input is used."
  ]
